      "updated_at": "2019-06-06T15:52:04Z",
      "body": "That's entirely my fault. I was not aware of the fact that calling memcpy() with src=NULL and length 0 was undefined behaviour. I disagree that it should be undefined, but there is not much point in arguing against the C standard.",
